東序之秘寶，瑚璉之茂器。」除驃騎從事中郎。","note":"明帝第五子寶源，建武元年封廬陵。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context-ws1544250"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001:r0000","surface":"廬陵王","start":0,"end":3,"person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_E","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001","quote":"廬陵王寶源字智淵，明帝第五子也。","note":"寶源封爵。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian","book_id":"b-nanqishu-050","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian-ws2272731"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"ordinal":5,"position":"unspecified","scope":"sons_of_parent","source_term":"第五子","parent_person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","interpretation_status":"source_attested","assertion_id":"a-liang021-wangjiansihui-baoyuan-father","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_E","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-050","source_id":"s-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian-ws2272731","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001","quote":"廬陵王寶源字智淵，明帝第五子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001:m0003","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001:r0009"}]}],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[{"ordinal":5,"position":"unspecified","scope":"sons_of_parent","source_term":"第五子","parent_person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","interpretation_status":"source_attested","assertion_id":"a-liang021-wangjiansihui-baoyuan-father","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_E","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-050","source_id":"s-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian-ws2272731","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001","quote":"廬陵王寶源字智淵，明帝第五子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-050-xiaobaoyuan-wangjian:p001:m0003","object_person_reference